    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea, diarrhea, or loss of appetite</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fainting or lightheadedness</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Memory loss unchanged; no night-time confusion since the antihistamine was stopped</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood steadier; no hallucinations or agitation</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
